            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This Grandfather Spider said the battle was just a feint. If so, what was his plan...? And I just realized... where is Istar? Has anyone seen her?",
